\"body\">\n      <p>新华社北京3月16日电　近日，中共中央办公厅、国务院办公厅印发《提振消费专项行动方案》，并发出通知，要求各地区各部门结合实际认真贯彻落实。</p>\n      <p>《提振消费专项行动方案》全文如下。</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <h3 class=\"sec\">一、城乡居民增收促进行动</h3>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">（一）城乡居民收入促进行动。<span class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</span></p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">（二）[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">（三）[illegible]</p>\n      <h3 class=\"sec\">二、消费能力保障支持行动</h3>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">（五）[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"vtitle\">中办国办印发《提振消费专项行动方案》</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- middle zone -->\n  <div class=\"zone-mid\">\n    <p class=\"illegible\">（六）[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">（七）[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">（八）[illegible]</p>\n    <h3 class=\"sec\">三、服务消费提质惠民行动</h3>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p style=\"text-align:right;text-indent:0;\">（下转第四版）</p>\n    <hr class=\"thin\">\n    <p class=\"illegible\">综合医院加强儿科门急诊服务建设。</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]　2025年提高部分学生医疗补助水平，扩大学前儿童收入城镇的教育资源供给。</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- right zone: 三北工程 -->\n  <div class=\"zone-right\">\n    <div class=\"sub-head\">2024年\"三北\"工程完成各项建设任务 5700万亩</div>\n    <h2 class=\"big\">筑牢北疆绿色长城</h2>\n    <div class=\"byline\">本报记者　顾仲阳　董丝雨</div>\n    <hr class=\"rule\">\n    <div class=\"tag\">\"两重\"建设扎实推进</div>\n    <div class=\"cols3\">\n      <p>内蒙古自治区阿尔多斯市毛乌素沙地下，[illegible] 中的一片绿意，[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">\"我们开展防护工，目前七省用行政区的三省用界开，选展碳纤，直问\"三北\"工程建设和管护走出新路子。</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">2023年6月，在加强荒漠化综合防治和推进\"三北\"等重点生态工程建设座谈会上，习近平总书记发出打好\"三北\"工程攻坚战的总号令。</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">\"三北\"工程有关地区和部门强化[?]措施，[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ BOTTOM ROW ============ -->\n<div class=\"bottom\">\n\n  <!-- 稳外资 -->\n  <div class=\"b-left\">\n    <h2>如何进一步做好<br>稳 外 资 工 作</h2>\n    <div class=\"byline\">本报记者　罗珊珊</div>\n    <hr class=\"rule\">\n    <p>外资是我国建设现代化产业体系的重要力量。中央经济工作会议提出，\"深化外商投资促进体制机制改革\"\"持续打造'投资中国'品牌\"。今年的《政府工作报告》提出，\"持续营造市场化、法治化、国际化一流营商环境，让外资企业更安心、更放心\"。如何进一步做好稳外资工作？</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 照片 -->\n  <div class=\"b-mid\">\n    <div class=\"photo-note illegible\">\n      [illegible] 春光正好，[illegible] 油菜花 [illegible] 图为3月16日，游客在 [illegible] 观赏油菜花。<br>\n      日　磅辉（人民视觉）\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: 油菜花田与游客，居中，宽幅横图]</div>\n    <div class=\"byline illegible\">[illegible]（人民视觉）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 广东人才 -->\n  <div class=\"b-right\">\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <p class=\"illegible\">\"东西南北中，发展到广东。\"求贤若渴的粤港澳大湾区 [illegible] 广州市暨广交会展馆比拟可见。</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">3月16日，2025年春季粤港澳联合招聘 [illegible] 举行，[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illegible\">[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"vkicker\">推出政策包，搭建\"百万英才汇南粤\"[?]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"vtitle2\">广东多措并举吸引人才就业创业</div>\n    <div class=\"vbyline\">本报记者　姜晓丹[?]</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ 导读 ============ -->\n<div class=\"guide\">\n  <div class=\"guide-col\">\n    <div class=\"k\">理论</div>\n    <div class=\"t\">发展银发经济</div>\n    <div class=\"t\">积极应对人口老龄化</div>\n    <div class=\"p\">第六版</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"guide-col\">\n    <div class=\"k\">春耕进行时</div>\n    <div class=\"t\">跟着课本探春耕</div>\n    <div class=\"p\">第五版</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"guide-badge\">导读</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"guide\">\n  <div class=\"guide-col\">\n    <div class=\"k\">弘扬科学家精神</div>\n    <div class=\"t\">星河未央　征途不止</div>\n    <div class=\"p\">第六版</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"policy-bar\">政策问答·扩大高水平对外开放</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
